    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Decide what to multiply each equation by to eliminate the $x$ variable.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "v2-9e3d4-p35-practice-slot-12-slot-12-q-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$2x+3y=7\\quad\\times$ ______\n\n$3x-2y=4\\quad\\times$ ______",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3,\\ 2$",
          "worked": "The LCM of $2$ and $3$ is $6$. Use multipliers $3$ and $2$, respectively:\n$$\\begin{align*}6x+9y&=21\\\\6x-4y&=8\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract to eliminate $x$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-9e3d4-p35-practice-slot-12-slot-12-q-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$3x+2y=8\\quad\\times$ ______\n\n$5x-4y=7\\quad\\times$ ______",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5,\\ 3$",
          "worked": "The LCM of $3$ and $5$ is $15$. Use multipliers $5$ and $3$, respectively:\n$$\\begin{align*}15x+10y&=40\\\\15x-12y&=21\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract to eliminate $x$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-9e3d4-p35-practice-slot-12-slot-12-q-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$4x=3y+5\\quad\\times$ ______\n\n$6x+5y=2\\quad\\times$ ______",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3,\\ 2$",
          "worked": "Rearrange the first equation: $4x-3y=5$.\nThe LCM of $4$ and $6$ is $12$. Use multipliers $3$ and $2$, respectively:\n$$\\begin{align*}12x-9y&=15\\\\12x+10y&=4\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract to eliminate $x$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      }
    ]
